OL,3,ANo sign of resolution as contentious
OL,4,AOrange Order parade blocked
OL,5,
OL,6,FBreandan Mac Cionnaith, from the
OL,7,FGarvaghy Road Residents Coalition
OL,8,F(GRRC) which was protesting against the
OL,9,Fmarch, says he will meet police and the
OL,10,FNI secretary today
OL,12,FNorthern Ireland First Minister
OL,13,FMichelle O'Neill, who was among the
OL,14,Fdemonstrators, urged protesters to
OL,15,F"stay the course" and says she "stands
OL,16,Fwith the residents"
